<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94642" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκάφος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span> (B), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hull of a ship</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.182
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.50
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν μέσῳ σκάφει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					803
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπτιοῦτο δὲ σκάφη νεῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					419
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναυτικὰ ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				1278
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀργοῦς σκάφος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Med.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναὸς</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεὼς ς</span>., poet. 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναῦς</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>IT</u>
				1345
			</span></i>, al.: generally, <i>ship</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδ᾽
				ἐπόντισε ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1013
			</span></i> (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.</u>
				440
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				541
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				9.69
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1755.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκάφευς ἀνάσσων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alcm.
					72
				</span></i>
			 (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Καφεύς</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κηφεύς</span>
			): metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλεως ς</span>. <i>the
				ship</i> of the state, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				29
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἴδιον κυβερνῆσαι ς</span>. 'paddle
			one's own <i>canoe</i>', <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				2.294
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>hollow of the</i> external <i>ear</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.85
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκαφεῖον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.21.7
			</span></i>.</div>
